     "description": "A fixture among the team leaders in both goals and points, Tom Wilson continued to be a driving force for the Capitals in his 13th season with the club. Renowned for his physical edge, Wilson\u2019s power-forward style also delivers consistent offensive production. Against the Rangers, he starts the sequence as the high forward, but when the puck pops loose in the slot, he explodes into the play\u2014beating everyone to it and wiring a shot top shelf for his second goal of the night. Capping off a dominant three-point performance (2 goals, 1 assist), Wilson earned First Star honors.\r\n\r\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
